/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Meta/Defs.lean#L1373-L1379"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.TSyntax.getString\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">TSyntax</span>.<span class=\"name\">getString</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.Syntax.StrLit\">StrLit</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Decodes a string literal, removing quotation marks and unescaping escaped characters.\n\nReturns `\"\"` if the syntax is malformed.","docLink":"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.TSyntax.getString","kind":"def","line":1365,"name":"Lean.TSyntax.getString","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Meta/Defs.lean#L1365-L1371"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.TSyntax.getScientific\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">TSyntax</span>.<span class=\"name\">getScientific</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.Syntax.ScientificLit\">ScientificLit</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Extracts the components of a scientific numeric literal.\n\nReturns a triple `(n, sign, e) : Nat × Bool × Nat`; the number's value is given by:\n\n```\nif sign then n * 10 ^ (-e) else n * 10 ^ e\n```\n\nReturns `(0, false, 0)` if the syntax is malformed.","docLink":"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.TSyntax.getScientific","kind":"def","line":1351,"name":"Lean.TSyntax.getScientific","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Meta/Defs.lean#L1351-L1363"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.TSyntax.getId\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">TSyntax</span>.<span class=\"name\">getId</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.Syntax.Ident\">Ident</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Extracts the parsed name from the syntax of an identifier.\n\nReturns `Name.anonymous` if the syntax is malformed.","docLink":"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.TSyntax.getId","kind":"def","line":1343,"name":"Lean.TSyntax.getId","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Init/Meta/Defs.lean#L1343-L1349"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.TSyntax.getHexNumSize\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">TSyntax</span>.<span class=\"name\">getHexNumSize</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.Syntax.HexNum\">Syntax.HexNum</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the number of hexadecimal digits.","docLink":"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.TSyntax.getHexNumSize